        {
          "text": "Ore pee elotu Daudi Mahanaim, ore Shobi olayioni le Nahash oing'uaa Raba oo lamori, o Makir olayioni le Amiel oing'uaa Lo-deba, o Barsilai o Lgiliadi ooing'uaa Rogelim, ",
          "type": "text",
